1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jacob Meier Goldschmidt, born 26 October 1824, Grebenstein, married Henriette Cahn in Frankfurt (daughter of Aaron Simon Cahn and Minna Gamburg).   Jacob died 20 January 1864 in Frankfurt. Jacob along with his brot
2 CONC her Selig, founded the firm of J & S Goldschmidt.  This art and antique firm ranked with the famous antique businesses of London, Paris, and New York, and it was the royal purveyor to the Tsar of Russia before WWI. 
2 CONT
