2 DATE 23 JAN 1927
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT imported from Evelyn Wilcock EandCW@@aol.com
2 CONT
2 CONT says 1843 on grave2  TITL Banking Collective
2 CONT
2 CONT 2  ORG A Merzbach, Rahmhofstr 2, FaM
2 CONT
2 CONT 2  DWEL 5
2 CONT
2 CONT 2  ROAD Westendstrasse
