2 CONT
2 CONT From: EandCW@@aol.com
2 CONT
2 CONT Date: Wed, 4 Aug 1999 13:25:13 EDT
2 CONT
2 CONT Subject: Merzbach of Frankfurt/Main
2 CONT
2 CONT To: davidlewin@@bigfoot.com
2 CONT
2 CONT Dear David,
2 CONT
2 CONT For about ten years now I have been trying to find out what happened to the family of my grandmother's aunt, Marie nee Heim and her husband Emanuel Merzbach 1837-95.  I have just got back from a (non-genealogical) research trip to
2 CONC  Frankfurt with some new info and saw from the JGFF Internet that you too are searching for Merzbachs from Frankfurt.  On this visit I copied a list of Merzbach names from the 1913 Frankfurt Addressbuch (Street Directory) and perh
2 CONC aps you may know who the people are. I should really like to know. My phone no is 0181 789 8712 and I am a member of the JGSGB. Evelyn Wilcock
2 CONT
2 CONT The 1913 Frankfurt Directory seems to indicate that Emanuel was a banker and that Marie and his children continued as partners of the bank after he died.
2 CONT
2 CONT Of the children, Ernst 1878-1932 died in Frankfurt and was buried with his parents. (I saw his grave in 1997)
2 CONT
2 CONT *Marie born Heim W.Endstr 5
