2 CONC ride: m.Bele Meyer. to:  Judith Gittele Mozes Druijff Traub, birth 1752 Amsterdam, died 16 Feb 1819 Amsterdam, Muiderberg cemetery: on 22 Shevat 1819 [17 Feb 1819] - Judic/Gittele Mozes Druijf, wife of Nathan Schuijer/Scheier. 
