1 NAME Isaac Albert /Palache/
2 GIVN Isaac Albert
2 _MARNM Palache
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 26 AUG 1888
2 ADDR
3 CITY Amsterdam
3 STAE NH
3 CTRY Netherlands
1 BURI
2 DATE 1958
2 ADDR
3 ADR1  Putney Hill
3 CITY London
3 STAE England
3 POST SW15
3 CTRY United Kingdom
1 DEAT
2 DATE 22 FEB 1958
2 ADDR
3 CITY London
3 STAE England
3 CTRY United Kingdom
1 OCCU Banker
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Palache, Albert. - Bankier. Geb. te Amsterdam, 26 Aug. 1888 als zoon van Abraham Palache, firmant van Gebr. Teixeira de Mattos, en Reina Musaphia. - P. bezocht in zijn geboortestad de 3e H.B.S. 5-j.c. en was van 19
2 CONC 05 tot 1908 werkzaam bij de fa. Gebr. Teixeira de Mattos. Gedurende de twee daaropvolgende jaren maakte P. reizen door Engeland en de Vereen. Staten van N.- Amerika. In 1910 ontving hij een aanstelling op het kantoor van de Schwei
2 CONC zerische Bankverein te Londen, waar hij tot 1913 bleef om vervolgens op te treden als vertegenwoordiger te Londen van het Amerikaansche Bankiershuis Hallgarten & Co. In 1919 werd P. benoemd tot Directeur der bankfirma Helbert, Wag
2 CONC g & Cie. Ltd., welke haar kantoren te Londen en New York heeft. - P. is president-commissaris der Finsbury Circus Estates Ltd., London en der Site Improvements Ltd., London, alsmede comm. Trust Ltd., London; Banque de Credit Rouma
2 CONC in, Boekarest; West Indies Sugar Co. Ltd., Londen; Labouchère & Co. N.V., Amsterdam; International Mortgage Bank, Bazel; Union Internationale de Placements, Paris; Helbert, Wagg Holdings Ltd., Londen. - Van 1911-1916 was hij als f
2 CONC inancieel correspondent te Londen aan het Alg. Handelsblad en de Nieuwe Rotterdamsche Courant verbonden. - P. bereisde in den loop der jaren West-Indië, Zuid-Amerika, de V.S. en, met uitzondering van Rusland, geheel Europa. - „Bee
2 CONC chworth", Hampstead Heath, Londen N.W. 3
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Albert Palache was my grandmother's second husband and she was his fifth (or possibly fourth) wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT His first wife was Flora Bouman, of Dutch origin, but born in Newcastle-upon-Tyne, England - they married in Amsterdam on 15 September 1910.  they had a daughter Muriel Olga Palache in September 1914.  Flora and Albert divorced in
2 CONC  1921. His second wife was Eleonora (Nelly) Bondy who was born in Prague in 1897 - marriage date unknown, but they were married by 1927 according to passenger records.  Nelly never remarried and remained known as Nelly Palache, li
2 CONC ving in London until her death in 1979. His third wife was Adriana Beukenkamp  they married in October 1932 His fourth wife was called Adeline - marriage date unknown, but her existence is shown on passenger records in 1934. but n
2 CONC o other records available to prove her existence.  It is possible that Adriana and Adeline are the same person as the age and place of birth of both Adriana and Adeline are the same according to the passenger records of Adeline an
2 CONC d the birth registration records of Adriana.  Adriana was divorced from Albert and living separately by 1939.  She remarried in 1940 to Jean Henri Tresfon.  His fifth (or possibly fourth) wife was Marie Louise Herzberg (nee Oppenh
2 CONC eimer) they married in London in January 1948 and remained married until his death in 1958.
