2 CONT * Max Markus Adler was born in Frankfurt Main, Germany in 1886 to Joel and Helene nee Posen. He was a bookkeeper and married to Bertha nee Heymann. Prior to WWII he lived in Frankfurt Main, Germany. During the war he was in Amster
2 CONC dam, The Netherlands.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Max Markus was murdered in the Shoah.
2 CONT
2 CONT * This information is based on a Page of Testimony (displayed here) submitted by his niece, Helen Witzenhausen Adler
