1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Marie Moses was born in Altenkundstadt, Germany in 1876. Prior to WWII lived in Berlin, Germany. During the war was in Berlin, Germany. Deported with Transport I/49 from Berlin,Berlin,Berlin,Germany to Theresiensta
2 CONC dt,Ghetto,Czechoslovakia on 21/08/1942. Marie was murdered/perished in Minsk, Belorussia (USSR). This information is based on a List of deportation from Berlin found in Gedenkbuch Berlins der juedischen Opfer des Nazionalsozialism
2 CONC us, Freie Universitaet Berlin, Zentralinstitut fuer sozialwissenschaftliche Forschung, Edition Hentrich, Berlin 1995. From http://db.yadvashem.org/names/nameDetails.html?itemId=4122475&language=en
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie Moses was born in 1876. During the war was deported with Transport I/49 from Berlin,Berlin,Berlin,Germany to Theresienstadt,Ghetto,Czechoslovakia on 21/08/1942. Deported with transport Bs from Theresienstadt,Ghetto,Czechoslo
2 CONC vakia to Treblinka,Extermination Camp,Poland on 29/09/1942. Marie was murdered/perished in the Shoah. This information is based on a List of Theresienstadt camp inmates found in Terezinska Pametni Kniha/Theresienstaedter Gedenkbuc
2 CONC h, Terezinska Iniciativa, vol. I-II Melantrich, Praha 1995, vol. III Academia Verlag, Prag 2000. From http://db.yadvashem.org/names/nameDetails.html?itemId=4848532&language=en
2 CONT
2 CONT Das Ehepaar Marie und Hermann Moses lebte zuletzt in der Opitzstraße 6 in Berlin-Steglitz. 
