2 CONT * 29. September 1942, Treblinka, Vernichtungslager
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Sara Lorenz nee Seeligberg was born in Altenkundstadt, Germany in 1869. Prior to WWII she lived in Berlin, Germany. During the war she was in Berlin, Germany. Deported with Transport I/49 from Berlin,Berlin,Berlin,Germany to There
2 CONC sienstadt,Ghetto,Czechoslovakia on 21/08/1942. Sara was murdered/perished in Minsk, Belorussia (USSR). This information is based on a List of deportation from Berlin found in Gedenkbuch Berlins der juedischen Opfer des Nazionalsoz
2 CONC ialismus, Freie Universitaet Berlin, Zentralinstitut fuer sozialwissenschaftliche Forschung, Edition Hentrich, Berlin 1995. http://db.yadvashem.org/names/nameDetails.html?itemId=4118943&language=en
2 CONT
2 CONT Probably more reliable, as the record is from Terezin:  Sara Lorentz nee Seeligberg was born in 1869. During the war she was deported with Transport I/49 from Berlin,Berlin,Berlin,Germany to Theresienstadt,Ghetto,Czechoslovakia on
2 CONC  21/08/1942. Deported with transport Bs from Theresienstadt,Ghetto,Czechoslovakia to Treblinka,Extermination Camp,Poland on 29/09/1942. Sara was murdered/perished in the Shoah. This information is based on a List of Theresienstadt
2 CONC  camp inmates found in Terezinska Pametni Kniha/Theresienstaedter Gedenkbuch, Terezinska Iniciativa, vol. I-II Melantrich, Praha 1995, vol. III Academia Verlag, Prag 2000. http://db.yadvashem.org/names/nameDetails.html?itemId=4847
2 CONC 899&language=en
