2 CONC erland&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;Marriage: Spouse: Gabriel Emil Guggenheim - Aug 12 1878 - Basel, Basel-Stadt, Basel City, Switzerland&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;Death: 1930 - Basel, Switzerland&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;Father: &lt;a&gt;Samuel Dreyfus&lt;/a
