2 CONC t;, &lt;a&gt;Clemence Wimpfheimer (born Guggenheim)&lt;/a&gt;&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;Siblings: &lt;a&gt;Hermine Levy (born Dreyfus)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a&gt;Isaac Dreyfus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a&gt;Benoit Dreyfus- Brettauer (born Dreyfus)&lt;/a&gt;
2 CONC , &lt;a&gt;Mathilde Hirsch (born Dreyfus)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a&gt;Jules Dreyfus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a&gt;Clemence Brettauer (born Dreyfus)&lt;/a&gt;  Record 40000:252257956: 
